jkQ3IcHCKYBKBM",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwjT3Jj4vdKWAxUnn68BHWZeKjkQ3IcHCKcBKBQ",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_DISH_RECOMMENDATION"],"你推薦哪道料理？",null,[[[["M:/g/11w2l35vj8"],"湯 泡系鴨",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjT3Jj4vdKWAxUnn68BHWZeKjkQ3YcHCKkBKAA"]],[1]],null,"建議的餐點",null,"0ahUKEwjT3Jj4vdKWAxUnn68BHWZeKjkQ3IcHCKgBKBU",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_NOISE_LEVEL"],"你覺得吵雜程度如何？",[[[["E:DINING_NOISE_LEVEL_QUIET"],"安靜，適合交談",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjT3Jj4vdKWAxUnn68BHWZeKjkQ3YcHCKsBKAA"]],1],null,null,"吵雜程度",null,"0ahUKEwjT3Jj4vdKWAxUnn68BHWZeKjkQ3IcHCKoBKBY",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["現在外面的候位單寫人數跟等級候位，等店員叫你們入店時，先去點餐機點餐，只能現金付款，點好餐之後把明細給店員，並坐在指定的位子上，有提供兩種冰水，覺得太鹹也可以自行加清湯。\n\n🥢鴨蔥淡麗鴨拉麵（醬油底）：好吃！拉麵整體和湯頭都不會太鹹，湯底的尾韻有淡淡淡醬油香，麵也很好吃，裡面有鴨肉塊和外面有兩片肉，都很嫩很好咬，泡一下下的柑橘跟檸檬片有增加湯底的層次，讓整個拉麵不是只有醬油味，整體來說很好吃，很推薦！\n\n🥢鴨蔥淡麗柑橘鴨拉麵（醬油底）：超讚超好吃！與前者差在多了柑橘醬？就是多白白的，攪拌後整個湯底又更有層次了，前段是柑橘的酸甜味後面是醬油香，麵跟鴨肉一樣都很好吃，會讓人停不下來一直想吃，真的大推薦！\n\n🥢泡系迷你叉燒飯（鴨醬油香版）：裝的很滿很豐盛，口味偏重鹹，飯很普通（不軟），攪拌均勻吃還不錯，但吃兩口就會想喝一口冰水，沒有到很習慣吃這麼鹹。",null,[0,85]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17347037834898378119/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVrYTFkVk1YSlNTR2cwVmpCcmVtRklTbXBqYmtFeVdtdDRUMDVYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17347037834898378119/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVrYTFkVk1YSlNTR2cwVmpCcmVtRklTbXBqYmtFeVdtdDRUMDVYWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/17347037834898378119/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVrYTFkVk1YSlNTR2cwVmpCcmVtRklTbXBqYmtFeVdtdDRUMDVYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17347037834898378119/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVrYTFkVk1YSlNTR2cwVmpCcmVtRklTbXBqYmtFeVdtdDRUMDVYWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/